From: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 10:27:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 16/17] OSD: the subtitle button stays enabled without
 subtitles

Its dialog is also where subtitles are downloaded, so a film without
any still needs it. Touches VideoOSD.xml.
---
 xml/VideoOSD.xml | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/xml/VideoOSD.xml b/xml/VideoOSD.xml
index 1ac9799..004edee 100644
--- a/xml/VideoOSD.xml
+++ b/xml/VideoOSD.xml
@@ -748,7 +748,6 @@
 						</include>
 						<onfocus>RunScript(special://skin/extras/mediainfo.py,player)</onfocus>
 							<onclick>DialogSelectSubtitle</onclick>
-						<enable>VideoPlayer.HasSubtitles</enable>
 					</control>
 					<control type="radiobutton" id="70060">
 						<description>Audio stream selection</description>
